# Cinderfall's lava tubes and Forgekeeper Johnny (CIPlay cinderfall_caves, 11-12 w09; in a test world 'CI ...').
# Points as in the recipe: mouth B on the ash field at -45 18.5, mouth A off the turbine hall's flats at -28 27, the
# two meet at -36 9; the slag chamber round -16 -6, the annex branch from -39 10.5 to the annex at -46 -6 (hatch at
# -46.5 -6.5, opened only after a talk with Johnny at 55 29.5). Floors ~4-4.5 (each stroke's own mouth).
island Cinderfall keep
offset 0.9743 -0.0458
hour 11
weather Calm
# (a CI world's bag emptied first: a full bag drops the loot)
empty
expect hidden cf_annexchest

# In by mouth B, through to the slag chamber
picture cf_tubes_out -51 +3 25 -45 +1.5 18.5
walk -48 22 to -45 18.5 to -42 12 to -36 9 to -33 11 to -27 3 to -21 -3 to -17 -5.5
picture cf_tubes_in -17.5 5.0 -5.1 -26 4.6 2 light=20

# The annex branch: the hatch locked before anyone talked to Johnny
walk -21 -3 to -27 3 to -33 11 to -36 9 to -39 10.5 to -42 3 to -44 -2 to -45.2 -4.6
use cf_annexhatch stay
expect message Ask the forge
expect shown cf_annexhatch
expect hidden cf_annexchest

# Forgekeeper Johnny by the ruined survey house
picture cf_islander 53.4 4.3 25.6 55 4.0 29.5
use Forgekeeper Johnny
expect step 0

# Now the hatch opens on the annex chest
walk -45 18.5 to -42 12 to -39 10.5 to -42 3 to -44 -2 to -45.2 -4.6
use cf_annexhatch stay
expect message spare stock
expect hidden cf_annexhatch
expect shown cf_annexchest
open Johnny's annex
wait 2
expect item CopperIngot 2

# His answers: 1 the machete, 3 the offcuts, 2 the Drowned Gate (journal)
use Forgekeeper Johnny pick 1
expect message machete for the weed
use Forgekeeper Johnny pick 3
expect message three offcuts
expect item Scrap 3
use Forgekeeper Johnny pick 2
expect message culverts under the wall

# Out by mouth A
walk -36 9 to -30 13 to -28 20 to -28 27 to -28 31
